  "job_B21.1.1.3_20251003_114533": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0 gehwylce wommas of lichoman onweg to nimenne, genim ylpenban mid hunige gecnucud & to Wundorlice hyt \u00fea wommas of genime\u00f0. Eft wi\u00f0 wommas of andwlatan to donne, gyf wifman mid \u00feam sylfan duste d\u00e6ghwamlice hyre Wi\u00f0 ealle sar, gyf \u00feu on foreweardon sumera \u00feigest hwylcne hwelp na \u00feonne gyt geseondne, ne Wi\u00f0 fortogenysse, drince hundes blod, hyt h\u00e6le\u00fe wundorlice. Wi\u00f0 geswel \u00fe\u00e6ra gecyndlima, hundes heafodpanne gecnucud & to gelegd, wundorlice heo h\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 cynelice adle, wedehundes heafod gecnucud & mid wine gemenged to drence, hyt h\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 cancorwund, hundes heafod to acxan geb\u00e6rned & on gestreded, hit \u00fea cancorwunda geh\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 scurfedum n\u00e6glum, geb\u00e6rned hundes heafod & seo acxe \u00fe\u00e6ron gedon, \u00fea ungerisnu hyt onweg Wi\u00f0 wedehundes slite, hundes heafod geb\u00e6rned to acxan & \u00fe\u00e6ron gedon, eall \u00fe\u00e6t attor & \u00fea fulnysse Eft, wedehundes heafod & his lifer gesoden & geseald to etanne \u00feam \u00fee tosliten bi\u00f0, wundorlice hyt To gehwylcum bryce, hundes br\u00e6gen aled on wulle & on \u00fe\u00e6t tobrocene to gewri\u00feen feowertyne \u00deonne by\u00fe hyt f\u00e6ste gebatod, & \u00fe\u00e6r by\u00f0 \u00feearf to f\u00e6stere gewri\u00f0ennysse. Wi\u00f0 eagwr\u00e6ce & stice, tobrec hundes heafod",
